{"ts":"2026-08-28T15:37:36.994Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"7405dc9b453c8154184ac8fe","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-28T15:37:36.994Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-28T15:37:36.994Z","author":"claude","text":"Measured, not claimed. The suite reaches 100 percent line, branch and function coverage across 36 files and 674 tests, and the docstring gate reports 177 documented declarations. The round-trip properties were then revert-checked, and the first attempt found a hole rather than confirming the tests: swapping the description and author lines in the canonical series encoding left all 27 series tests green. Every one of them compares a round-trip against itself, so they hold under any self-consistent encoding while a change to it would make every series object ever written unreadable. A series is a transfer format, so the encoding is now pinned to exact bytes by its own test, and that test is itself revert-checked: the same swap now turns it red while the other 27 stay green."}]}],"before_hash":"374f90a082a27397c0a7ad46e101b48d532617bf8ec38e5995731bccb81670ca","after_hash":"6b9d4e5ecfa4a24f56d827d0f10feff9fad25f8226645f82dc53f982fb40c89e","item_hash_version":2,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
